edit_instructions.target_text:
### Nonce Verification
```php
// Creating nonce
wp_nonce_field( 'action_name', 'nonce_field_name' );

// Verifying nonce
if ( ! isset( $_POST['nonce_field_name'] ) ||
     ! wp_verify_nonce( $_POST['nonce_field_name'], 'action_name' ) ) {
    wp_die( 'Security check failed' );
}
```

